        <li role="tab" id="tabs-f29b54cfdb-item-25709be442-tab" class="cmp-tabs__tab" aria-controls="tabs-f29b54cfdb-item-25709be442-tabpanel" tabindex="-1" data-cmp-hook-tabs="tab">Software &amp; Ecosystem</li>
